      "Run indexing only with a supported project-contained standalone runtime; reject external interpreters, escaping runtime directories or executable links, unsupported versions, failed probes and invalid marked processes.",
      "Probe runtime selection without a shell under a bounded timeout, preserve arguments during a single marked re-execution, ignore legacy interpreter overrides and retain existing indexing, worker, locking and store behavior.",
