      "Exclude only complete unquoted integer byte-count values under keys ending in _bytes from phone detection in ordinary and JSON-escaped text; preserve phone detection for other keys, quoted values and unkeyed text, and preserve original-byte email and digest checks.",
      "Bind proposal revision constants with the corresponding string or null type while preserving exact prior-contract binding and leaving the canonical output schema unchanged.",
      "Retain unchanged deterministic assertion-based fail-before/pass-after evidence for the repaired behavior, replacing obsolete interpreter-override expectations without weakening independent proposal or shipment safeguards.",
      "Prepare patch release metadata consistently across canonical and generated products while preserving package composition, transport, authentication declarations and private-runtime exclusion."
    ],
